# Voice kit samples live in public/voice-kit/{voice}/{word}.wav (16-bit PCM,
# 24 kHz mono) and are committed intentionally so the repo can rebuild
# the pack without external source files. iOS WebKit decodes plain WAV
# universally; the Opus-in-OGG path was rejected by iOS < 17.
